{"id":"8117181d976a8fb1","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-equational-derivation.md","title":"代数等式的有限推导闭包","display":"df-equational-derivation — 代数等式的有限推导闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-equational-derivation","aliases":["16-df-equational-derivation"],"display":"df-equational-derivation — 代数等式的有限推导闭包","depends_on":["[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]"],"source":"Definitions 3.2.1, 3.2.5 pp.178,181–182 (PDF198,201–202); basic rules p.179 (PDF199)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-equational-derivation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-equational-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equational-derivation — 代数等式的有限推导闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 3.2.1, 3.2.5 pp.178,181–182 (PDF198,201–202); basic rules p.179 (PDF199)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}\\)</span> 和替换采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afcc53893d447b1b\" href=\"?note=afcc53893d447b1b\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-signature\">16-df-algebraic-signature</a>，下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 在本页省略。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 缩写树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\">\\(e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\)</span> 编码无条件等式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是有限等式集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\)</span> 编码一步推理。所有构造在固定宇宙中进行；以下集合式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},\\ \\sigma\\in S,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},\\ \\sigma\\in S,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,t))\\mid t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,s))\\mid s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,s),(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,t))\\mid r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,a(f)_i,s_i,t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le|a(f)|\\},(\\Gamma,b(f),f(\\vec s),f(\\vec t)))\\mid\nf\\in F,\\ \\vec s,\\vec t\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Gamma,a(f))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Delta,\\sigma,s[\\rho],t[\\rho]))\\mid\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\ \\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_{n+1}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq D_n(A)\\cup\\{e\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D_n(A))\\ (P,e)\\in\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD_\\Sigma(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(A),\\\\\nA\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in D_\\Sigma(A),\\\\\ns\\sim^{\\Gamma,\\sigma}_A t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,t))\\mid t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,s))\\mid s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,s),(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,t))\\mid r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,a(f)_i,s_i,t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le|a(f)|\\},(\\Gamma,b(f),f(\\vec s),f(\\vec t)))\\mid\nf\\in F,\\ \\vec s,\\vec t\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Gamma,a(f))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Delta,\\sigma,s[\\rho],t[\\rho]))\\mid\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\ \\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_{n+1}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq D_n(A)\\cup\\{e\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D_n(A))\\ (P,e)\\in\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD_\\Sigma(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(A),\\\\\nA\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in D_\\Sigma(A),\\\\\ns\\sim^{\\Gamma,\\sigma}_A t&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条规则只有有限个前提，因此该逐层构造正是有限推导树闭包。反身、对称、传递使每个型属上的关系为等价关系；函数同余与替换规则使它成为替换同余。</p>\n<p>与原书四条基本规则的对应：replacement 由项结构归纳和函数同余得到；反过来逐参数使用 replacement，再用传递性，可推出函数同余。同时替换由单变量替换、换名和结构规则推出；任意变量选择的替换包含弱化、交换和收缩。因此这是原书无条件代数等式片段的等价呈现，并未把有条件 Horn 理论的完备性一并断言。没有依赖尚待重建的 DTT 接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-signature","status":"resolved","id":"afcc53893d447b1b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{Ctx}$、$\\mathsf{Tm}$ 和替换采用 [[16-df-algebraic-signature]]，下标 $\\Sigma$ 在本页省略。$f(\\vec t)$ 缩写树 $\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1,f,\\vec t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"e=(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf R_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx},\\ \\sigma\\in S,\\ s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\coloneqq{}&\\{(\\varnothing,(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,t))\\mid t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,t,s))\\mid s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,s),(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Gamma,\\sigma,r,t))\\mid r,s,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,a(f)_i,s_i,t_i)\\mid1\\le i\\le|a(f)|\\},(\\Gamma,b(f),f(\\vec s),f(\\vec t)))\\mid\nf\\in F,\\ \\vec s,\\vec t\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Gamma,a(f))\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{(\\{(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\},(\\Delta,\\sigma,s[\\rho],t[\\rho]))\\mid\ns,t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,\\sigma),\\ \\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nD_0(A)&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\nD_{n+1}(A)&\\coloneqq D_n(A)\\cup\\{e\\in\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma\\mid(\\exists P\\subseteq D_n(A))\\ (P,e)\\in\\mathsf R_\\Sigma\\},\\\\\nD_\\Sigma(A)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D_n(A),\\\\\nA\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t)\\in D_\\Sigma(A),\\\\\ns\\sim^{\\Gamma,\\sigma}_A t&\\Longleftrightarrow A\\vdash_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma,s,t).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2801,"backlinks":[{"id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 及 $A\\subseteq\\mathsf{AEq}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-equational-derivation]]。$[t]^{\\Gamma,\\sigma}_A$ 是 $\\sim^{\\Gamma,\\sigma}_A$ 的等价类；$\\Gamma=(\\sigma_i)_{i=1}^n$、$\\Delta=(\\tau_j)_{j=1}^m$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-signature]]、[[16-df-equational-derivation]]、[[16-df-algebraic-category]]、[[16-thm-algebraic-category]]、[[16-df-algebraic-model]]、[[16-df-conditional-equational-derivation]]、[[16-lem-lawvere]]、[[16-thm-completeness-eq]]。条件等式现有本书内分类纤维化和模型扩张构造，见 [[16-df-equational-classifying-fibration]]、[[16-df-equational-fibred-model]]、[[16-thm-model-characterization]]。"},{"id":"02c74c6f1c19991c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["afcc53893d447b1b"]}